led capacity of 34,707 MW. Wind and solar together accounted for 26.4% of total generation, while micro and mini distributed generation accounted for 7.0%.","zh":"EPE的2025年数据表明，太阳能光伏发电量为88.1太瓦时、装机容量为64,793兆瓦，风电发电量为116.5太瓦时、装机容量为34,707兆瓦。风电和太阳能合计占总发电量的26.4%，微型和小型分布式发电占7.0%。"},"unit":null,"year":null}],"extractionMethod":"manual","uncertainty":null},{"factId":"fact-23ca2a3293b7ec25","fieldPath":"marketOverview.population","status":"candidate","evidence":[{"sourceId":"world-bank-population","locator":"json:/1/0/value","rawValue":212812405,"normalizedValue":212812405,"unit":"people","year":2025}],"extractionMethod":"deterministic","uncertainty":null},{"factId":"fact-d2f22001f3963d95","fieldPath":"marketOverview.renewableTarget","status":"candidate","evidence":[{"sourceId":"brazil-ipea-ods7-renewable-target","locator":"html:meta-7-2-brasil#renewable-energy-national-energy-matrix-2030","rawValue":{"heading":"Meta 7.2 - Brasil","target":"Ate 2030, manter elevada a participacao de energias renovaveis na matriz energetica nacional."},"normalizedValue":{"en":"Brazil's stated target is to maintain a high share of renewable energy in the national energy matrix by 2030. This is a qualitative target, not a numeric target and not specific to the electricity matrix.","zh":"巴西提出到2030年维持可再生能源在全国能源矩阵中的高占比。这是定性目标，不是数值目标，也不特指电力矩阵。"},"unit":null,"year":null}],"extractionMethod":"manual","uncertainty":"IPEA states a qualitative target for the national energy matrix; it is not numeric, not electricity-specific, and is not characterized here as a legal obligation."},{"factId":"fact-77a3f126639e9ebb","fieldPath":"marketOverview.source","status":"candidate","evidence":[{"sourceId":"brazil-epe-ben-2026-summary","locator":"metadata:/sourceName","rawValue":"Empresa de Pesquisa Energetica (EPE)","normalizedValue":"Empresa de Pesquisa Energetica (EPE)","unit":null,"year":null}],"extractionMethod":"deterministic","uncertainty":null},{"factId":"fact-59776c7311313e06","fieldPath":"marketOverview.sour